sangati mithuna

  "shiva-shakti-abheda prashna-amsha-yukta dharana-jivamsha-yukta"
  "sparsha-kriya resonance-swarupa sphoTa-phala"
  "taranga-yukta interference-abheda thaalam-siddha"
  "ananda-janya bhava-swarupa samsarga-phala"

  shabda shiva-shakti, prashna-amsha, dharana-jivamsha, sparsha, resonance, sphoTa, taranga, interference, thaalam, ananda, bhava, samsarga

done
